Improper Input Validation and Command Injection The application processes user-uploaded files and frame numbers without explicit validation, which could lead to command injection via the `ffmpeg` command., Improper Handling of File Uploads The application handles file uploads without restrictions on file size or type, which could lead to resource exhaustion or storage of malicious files.

